{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROJECT HUNT \u2013\u00a0LONE STAR HUNTING RANCH DLC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the wilds of South Texas brush country and experience the true thrill of the hunt!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/f0428ede6e4e16d4cf7192bfca3a0ea5.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/221df155f4eb0d92f0e41acf1078c53d.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/e7d6630985117ad10a3f64fecb87d18a.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 6 New Animal Species</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six brand-new animals roam the ranch, waiting to be hunted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/ba2447118950b0901ef3851d7b220bf8.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/35e8ae7239945b30c0fa36d8ba0da1cc.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/3652bbedffbe374f5a336f9274aa38c6.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/b9ac3e3d44e8f4146e5c7a31811b848e.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/9e9a53be509f06c97687ea49744a5273.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/6ba0ea6758991f7796c2b3ab8cdbf209.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Legendary Elk &amp; Bighorn Sheep</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter the majestic Legendary Elk and Bighorn Sheep across the ranch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/dbe924f38019975311c7869ad9895a32.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/c3ea46be68fd545397020debf3762262.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 A New Way to Hunt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use strategically placed feeders to lure animals closer, then take your shot from nearby hunting stands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/7ad47e6af4cb0b8a21e3b6ea2a3a6196.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/026f8d1ef5d10f7c6eca73588c3148fa.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Field Dressing, Grilling &amp; Buff System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest animals to obtain raw meat.<br>Grill the meat to create unique meals that grant special buffs, with effects varying by animal type.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/12384760f6661683ac4fc7872b12ad54.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/a2e5dade7d9f0a8ffa0a583c97c1ba80.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 A New Base Camp with NPCs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ranch features a fully equipped camp, complete with helpful NPCs:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bar</strong> \u2013 Purchase drinks to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/dae8248fd20619f6dd1ff417ed17face.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gun Shop</strong> \u2013 Acquire firearms and essential hunting gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/f887cf4088ab34e75669370b8f674b8a.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Butcher</strong> \u2013 Process your harvest into raw cuts of meat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/343262fe20867faa070e638f64a99e55.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garage</strong> \u2013 Access and manage your vehicles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/b790ffb39efae35ce924b74da160e35f.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=727 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lodge</strong> \u2013 Display your trophies and relax by the fireplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/94f20d4043dde4533ee8e110cc68398b.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Shooting Range</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself at the brand-new shooting range.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record Mode</strong>: Aim for the highest score and fastest full-clear across 20 fixed targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong>: Train with targets that change in size each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/b44142acf9afe2aaa5f8e13f12262d6d.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/77a96ebf499b8c3300e5935f318eeb63.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/1ca7030eb3311ff6a6eb1926fcff0857.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/f2536a76baf4ce89c9b90495a4ba495c.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Vehicle: SUV</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a powerful new SUV, available through the ranch mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/cf05bc1ebc0181f56c0eb7c6d1311ed9.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/1316857987ce1176718b1a28e3f5523c.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Medieval Cannon Firing Range</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back in time and fire authentic medieval cannons.<br>Hit the targets to earn rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/85cce24591a5fc9f21a82734f5686d83.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/cfb368e1160eb0604f90eb4886050335.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 h