p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/94f20d4043dde4533ee8e110cc68398b.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Shooting Range</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself at the brand-new shooting range.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Record Mode</strong>: Aim for the highest score and fastest full-clear across 20 fixed targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Practice Mode</strong>: Train with targets that change in size each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/b44142acf9afe2aaa5f8e13f12262d6d.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/77a96ebf499b8c3300e5935f318eeb63.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/1ca7030eb3311ff6a6eb1926fcff0857.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018820/extras/f2536a76baf4ce89c9b90495a4ba495c.avif?t=1758058218\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 New Vehicle: SUV</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a powerful new SUV, available through the ranch mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img c